        "headline": "The deploy checklist nobody can skip at 5pm on a Friday",
        "body": "Paste in the runbook you already keep in Notion. Holdpoint turns every step into a gate that a named person has to check off before the next one opens, and it records who checked what, on which commit, at what time. When an auditor asks in March, you send a link instead of losing an afternoon.",
